{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>\r\n\t\t\t亞殘運輪椅劍擊項目，港隊於女子重劍團體賽決賽不敵國家隊，增添一面銀牌。<br/>\n<br/>\r\n港隊由余翠怡、林嘉雯、湯雅婷及范佩珊四名劍手組成，開賽後被逐步拉開分數，首節完落後1:5。最後兩節未能取得分數，最終以10:30落敗，取得亞軍。<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\r\n編輯：譚佩貞\t\t</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-22T05:01:06.486673+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":115,"images":0,"source":"RTHK 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-22T04:32:19+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-22T06:38:00.448798+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-22T04:57:46.743122+00:00","content_hash":"73c13303650e9d53c2899ba6a90de7f96ce86dcc2377f7c3db59d4385f8af398","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}